WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.400
App Composer starts with a sentence. Your agent builds an app you own.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:19.400
Get Ready checks the machine and the account before anything is built.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:29.400
Init turns the idea into a specification you can read, save and change.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.600
The handoff is a real document your agent can follow.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.400
The studio is built on your account, with its own database and storage.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:51.600
Every still, clip and song is saved in the app you own.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:01:00.400
Six scenes from one song, each with a reference and a take.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:07.600
A 33-second cut, mixed and rendered, kept in the library.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:15.400
Publishing is deliberate: signed out, credited, reversible.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.400
Build your own media studio at composer.loftwah.com.
